In my opinion the most exciting improvement the dev team could make to
Nethack would be to make monsters be capable of using the items that you
currently find on their corpses. I have no idea how hard this would be
to implement, however. Very difficult, perhaps.

This may swing game balance too far in favour of the monsters. Perhaps
it would need to be well regulated, otherwise you could die like on
level 1;
	 the goblin zaps his wand of lightning  -more-
	 you are fried to a crisp  -more-
	 you die  -more-

A bit harsh that would be. Perhaps could have more chests to get goodies
and have less such things on monsters.

Currently there is a hard option set at compile time. Maybe there could
be an "even harder" option, with smart, object using monsters.

